  "story": {
    "title": "My fantastic school!",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "It's Monday. A new school week is starting. I'm happy because I'm going to school.",
      "It's a sunny day, today. There are some clouds in the sky but it's warm. As soon as arrive at my school I greet my teacher and my schoolfriends. \" Hello teacher! Hello friends! \" \" Hello Tom! How are you? \" \" Fine, thanks! And you? \" \" I'm very well, thank you! \"",
      "During lesson our schoolbags talk to each other friendly . Look! They're nice and colourful!",
      "It's breaktime! We're in the school playground. We're having fun!",
      "Lesson is finished. I'm a little tired but very happy. \" Goodbye everyone! See you tomorrow! \""
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "It's Monday. A new school week is starting.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_130094/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Hôm nay là thứ Hai. Một tuần học mới đang bắt đầu."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I'm happy because I'm going to school.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_130094/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Con vui lắm vì con được đi học."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "It's a sunny day, today.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_130094/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Hôm nay trời nắng đẹp."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "There are some clouds in the sky but it's warm.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_130094/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Có vài đám mây trên trời nhưng trời ấm áp."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "As soon as arrive at my school I greet my teacher and my schoolfriends.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_130094/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Vừa đến trường, con chào cô giáo và các bạn học của con."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\" Hello teacher!",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_130094/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chào cô giáo ạ!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Hello friends! \" \" Hello Tom!",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_130094/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chào các bạn!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "How are you?",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_130094/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chào Tom! Con khỏe không?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\" \" Fine, thanks!",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_130094/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Con khỏe, cảm ơn ạ!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "And you? \" \" I'm very well, thank you! \"",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_130094/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Còn cô/bạn thì sao?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "During lesson our schoolbags talk to each other friendly .",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_130094/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Trong giờ học, những chiếc cặp sách của chúng tớ trò chuyện với nhau rất thân thiện."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Look! They're nice and colourful!",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_130094/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nhìn kìa! Chúng thật đẹp và nhiều màu sắc!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "It's breaktime! We're in the school playground.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_130094/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Giờ ra chơi rồi! Chúng tớ đang ở sân chơi của trường."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "We're having fun!",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_130094/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng tớ đang rất vui!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Lesson is finished.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_130094/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Giờ học đã kết thúc."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I'm a little tired but very happy.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_130094/s_015.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Con hơi mệt một chút nhưng rất vui."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\" Goodbye everyone!",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_130094/s_016.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tạm biệt mọi người!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "See you tomorrow! \"",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_130094/s_017.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Hẹn gặp lại ngày mai!"
      }
    ]
  },
